    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0150" n="62" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg62"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Egan.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan is informed that Chile’s offer of $75,000 indemnity in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi> case will be cordially accepted, subject
                    to the condition named; and is directed to receive and accept payment by
                    exchange of notes as promptly as possible.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
